                   sec:hasCVEID "CVE-2024-13879" ;
                   sec:hasCVSSScore 5.5 ;
                   sec:hasDescription "The Stream plugin for WordPress is vulnerable to Server-Side Request Forgery in all versions up to, and including, 4.0.2 due to insufficient validation on the webhook feature. This makes it possible for authenticated attackers, with administrator-level access and above, to make web requests to arbitrary locations originating from the web application which can be used to query and modify information from internal services." .


